1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:06,975
A model, a harness, and a month-end close. Follow how the agent works, and how it is checked.
一个模型、一套 Harness、一次月末结账。看 Agent 如何工作，又如何被检验。

2
00:00:08,702 --> 00:00:16,189
July books lock on the fifth of August. Six pending entries have been filed, and each one needs a decision.
七月账务 8 月 5 日锁账。共享中心提交了六条待入账意见，每一条都要作出处理。

3
00:00:17,914 --> 00:00:23,902
Fifty-five source files go in. A Word report and an Excel workbook must come out.
输入是五十五份材料，要交付一份 Word 报告和一份 Excel 底稿。

4
00:00:25,638 --> 00:00:33,076
The model works through Claude Code, inside a Docker container. The scoring rubric stays sealed, out of its reach.
模型通过 Claude Code，在 Docker 容器里工作。评分标准处于封存状态，Agent 接触不到。

5
00:00:34,802 --> 00:00:42,577
First request: read the register of pending entries. Claude Code runs it in Docker, and the six rows come back.
第一个请求：读取待入账意见登记表。Claude Code 在 Docker 里执行，六行记录返回给模型。

6
00:00:44,302 --> 00:00:51,890
Then it writes its own plan: one line for each entry, D01 to D06, then the workbook and the report.
接着它自己列出计划：D01 到 D06 每项一条，然后是底稿和报告。

7
00:00:53,610 --> 00:01:01,548
To size the swap's value change, the model asks for two valuation dates. Docker pulls the rows and returns them.
为了量化互换的价值变动，模型要两个估值日的数据。Docker 取出对应行，返回给模型。

8
00:01:03,278 --> 00:01:09,366
With the evidence in hand, it writes the workbook. Five sheets appear in the output folder.
证据在手，它开始写底稿。输出目录里出现五张工作表。

9
00:01:11,098 --> 00:01:19,110
Then a real error. The script that polishes two sheets fails on a misspelled variable, and nothing from that run is saved.
接着出现一个真实的错误。美化两张表的脚本因变量名拼错而失败，这次运行的内容没有保存。

10
00:01:20,838 --> 00:01:28,463
It moves on and writes the Word report. D01 to D06 each get a section with a recommendation.
它继续往下，写 Word 报告。D01 到 D06 各有一节，并给出处理建议。

11
00:01:30,194 --> 00:01:38,306
Then it checks its own files. The first sheet still has only three rows. The earlier polish never saved.
然后它检查自己的文件。第一张表仍然只有三行，之前的美化根本没有保存。

12
00:01:40,030 --> 00:01:47,792
The agent finishes. Only now does Harbor put the tests into the same container, and a separate judge session starts.
Agent 完成交付。直到这时，Harbor 才把测试放进同一个容器，另起独立的裁判会话。

13
00:01:49,506 --> 00:01:57,618
The judge scores the two submitted files against the rubric, one criterion at a time. Nothing flows back to the agent.
裁判按评分标准逐条评审这两份提交的文件。评分结果不会回传给 Agent。

14
00:01:59,342 --> 00:02:07,942
One number matches: the hedge sensitivity. The agent copied it from a source sheet, and the judge recomputed it from the scenarios.
有一个数字对上了：套保敏感度。Agent 是从底稿里取用的，裁判用情景数据重新计算，结果一致。

15
00:02:09,682 --> 00:02:16,257
Entry D02 is subtler. The red line holds, but the treatment earns only half marks.
D02 更微妙。红线没有被触碰，但处理方式只拿到一半分数。

16
00:02:17,982 --> 00:02:23,757
And the workbook contains no formulas at all, so its amounts cannot be traced back to their sources.
而且底稿里一个公式都没有，金额无法追溯到来源。

17
00:02:25,490 --> 00:02:35,352
The reward is point three three three. Three criteria met, six partly met, eleven not met. One pilot run, not a ranking.
奖励值为 0.333：三项满足、六项部分满足、十一项未满足。这只是一次试跑，不是排名。

18
00:02:37,078 --> 00:02:42,378
From professional task to agent run, independent check, and what to improve next.
从专业任务到 Agent 运行，再到独立检验，以及下一步该改进什么。
